    "objection": "The statement that a free MCP tool would be more useful to developers is likely false because the MCP protocol is already integrated into popular development environments and tools, such as TensorFlow and PyTorch, which are widely used by developers. Developers do not need to rely on a standalone MCP tool to benefit from the protocol.",
    "falsification_test": "To test this claim, developers should be surveyed to determine if they currently use the MCP protocol in their development processes and if they would be more inclined to use a standalone MCP tool. Additionally, the cost and availability of the standalone tool should be compared to the cost and availability of the MCP protocol in existing development environments."
  }
